# 🏭 Green Processing — ERP Enterprise Transformatsiya Rejasi

> **Loyiha:** Green Processing ERP  
> **Sana:** 2026-yil 27-iyul  
> **Maqsad:** MVP → Enterprise darajasiga ko'tarish (13+ bo'lim, 20+ lavozim)

